<section class="gg-support-donate-hero">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-support-donate-card">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Support Goal Grower</span>

      <h1>Help this garden grow from beta to launch.</h1>

      <p>
        Goal Grower is being built to make goals feel visual, human, and easier
        to return to. Support helps fund testing, design polish, app store prep,
        and the next round of features.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-hero-actions center">
        <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-btn">Support the Project</a>
        <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-btn-soft">Become a Tester</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-support-impact">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-support-impact-intro">
      <span class="gg-kicker">What support does</span>
      <h2>Every contribution moves the app forward.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-impact-list">
      <div class="gg-impact-row">
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Testing</h3>
        <p>Helps get the app into real hands so bugs, confusing screens, and missing pieces can be found faster.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-impact-row">
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Design polish</h3>
        <p>Helps make the app feel clearer, calmer, more motivating, and easier to use every day.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-impact-row">
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Launch prep</h3>
        <p>Helps with store screenshots, listing content, testing requirements, and app release steps.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-impact-row">
        <span>04</span>
        <h3>Future features</h3>
        <p>Helps improve shared gardens, reminders, widgets, progress systems, and long-term goal support.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-support-options-unique">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Ways to help</span>
      <h2>Support does not have to look one way.</h2>
      <p>
        You can test the app, share feedback, support development, or buy products that help fund future work.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-support-paths">
      <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-support-path">
        <span>Test</span>
        <h3>Become a beta tester</h3>
        <p>Try Goal Grower and help decide what feels useful, confusing, or motivating.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-support-path main">
        <span>Give</span>
        <h3>Support development</h3>
        <p>Help fund the build directly while the app moves toward release.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-support-path">
        <span>Shop</span>
        <h3>Buy from the store</h3>
        <p>Support through digital tools, products, and future Goal Grower items.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-support-current-needs">
  <div class="gg-container gg-needs-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="gg-kicker light">Current needs</span>
      <h2>What the project needs next.</h2>
      <p>
        The app is not finished yet. The next stage is about testing, improving
        the experience, and getting closer to a real launch.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-needs-board">
      <div>
        <strong>Android testing</strong>
        <span>Make sure the app works well on real devices.</span>
      </div>

      <div>
        <strong>App walkthrough</strong>
        <span>Improve onboarding so new users understand the garden system quickly.</span>
      </div>

      <div>
        <strong>Shared garden polish</strong>
        <span>Make shared progress clearer and more motivating.</span>
      </div>

      <div>
        <strong>Store launch assets</strong>
        <span>Create screenshots, copy, and release materials for launch.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-support-thank-you">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-thank-you-panel">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Thank you</span>

      <h2>You are helping build something intentional.</h2>

      <p>
        Goal Grower is for people who want progress to feel alive instead of cold.
        Every tester, supporter, and piece of feedback helps shape that mission.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-hero-actions center">
        <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-btn">Support Now</a>
        <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-btn-soft">Join Testing</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Goal Grower Support",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Goal Grower Support"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}